        "model": "claude-haiku-5-5",
        "timestamp": 1791655455030,
        "delta": "The `db` service is removed from staging and the deploy finished. Deployment #5 ended with status `applied` and outcome `executed`. `web` and `worker` were redeployed and no longer list `db`.\n\nThe `pgdata` volume was kept. It's no longer mounted by any service, and its data is still there. I didn't remove it because that would permanently delete the Postgres data. If you want the volume gone too, tell me and I'll remove it, but that deletion can't be undone.",
        "content": "The `db` service is removed from staging and the deploy finished. Deployment #5 ended with status `applied` and outcome `executed`. `web` and `worker` were redeployed and no longer list `db`.\n\nThe `pgdata` volume was kept. It's no longer mounted by any service, and its data is still there. I didn't remove it because that would permanently delete the Postgres data. If you want the volume gone too, tell me and I'll remove it, but that deletion can't be undone."
      },
